I think a neat enhancement would be to make chatting your pet a bit more
useful.

#chatting your pet should have a finite chance of inducing your pet to:

	- drop the item it is carrying
	- pick up an item it is standing on
	- follow you
	- start/stop attacking a monster

Perhaps this would work better if your pet is happy (well fed).

Another neat trick would be if you could (a)pply the leash (which is
already on your pet) in a different direction from your pet, thereby
tugging on it.  That might induce your pet to walk that direction,
even though you aren't moving that way.  Keep away from the floating
eye corpse, Klepto!

